# Tierra del Fuego

id:world-tierra-del-fuego a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:altLabel "Terra del Fuego" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Tierra del Fuego" ;
    oa:kind "planet" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:uncertain false .

claim:location-world-tierra-del-fuego a prov:Entity, oa:LocationClaim ;
    oa:about id:world-tierra-del-fuego ;
    oa:canonical true ;
    oa:catalogueFromSource false ;
    oa:knownDistanceConflict false ;
    oa:method oa:DirectTranscription ;
    oa:note "Given as a colony in Epsilon Indi, on the project owner's reading. oaplanets.dsc, one of the Orion's Arm Celestia add-ons' location catalogues (OAAddons9, OALocationsv4; extracted to sources/derived/oa_dsc_locations.tsv), spells it \"Terra del Fuego\" and puts it at 11.8 ly, against Epsilon Indi's 11.867 -- so the add-on is naming this system. The spelling above is the one the real place bears and the add-on's is kept as an alternate.\nBound to the A component, which no source here states: A and B are about 1,500 AU apart and at this range that is nothing on the map. Epsilon Indi already carries the Gatlida and Praxis-Gnosis colonies, and how this stands to them is not recorded. See questions.md." ;
    oa:starName "Epsilon Indi A" .
